# Textline — API Key Health Monitor & Real-Time Diagnostics

Implemented and verified the **API Key Health Monitor** feature in Textline. Users can now independently test every configured `GEMINI_API_KEY_*` credential from `.env` in parallel without allowing one valid key to mask failures of other keys.

